## About the project

At PBB Creative, I led the design and development of Alwin Capital’s new corporate website, a platform that communicates the company’s vision for investing in science and innovation. The site presents concise, structured content focused on clarity, credibility, and strategic positioning.

A key feature of the website is the portfolio section, organised by industry sectors in which Alwin Capital operates. The purpose here was to enhance discoverability and allow users to quickly understand the breadth of the company’s investments, while maintaining a clean and professional visual language aligned with the brand.

